simulator lang=spectre
// Exploratory differential CMOS receiver with weak cross-coupled regeneration.
subckt rf_regen16k1_v13 (rfp rfn clk vdd vss)
CP (rfp gp) capacitor c=4p
CN (rfn gn) capacitor c=4p
RP (gp clk) resistor r=20k
RN (gn clkn) resistor r=20k
X0 (gp clk vdd vss) pll_inv wn=16u wp=40.0u
X1 (gn clkn vdd vss) pll_inv wn=16u wp=40.0u
XF0 (clkn clk vdd vss) pll_inv wn=1u wp=2.5u
XF1 (clk clkn vdd vss) pll_inv wn=1u wp=2.5u
ends rf_regen16k1_v13
